  "scope": "Testbench-only binding of the three predeclared active-state events. It observes only named accepted R5/R6 carriers, with no internal-state inference, production-top scoreboard, numeric, HBM, model/GPU, timing, throughput, PPA, RTL-equivalence, or new A4 DSE claim.",
